1
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,320
I sneak up close to you

2
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,510
then tap your shoulder — tap!

3
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:15,380
the look on your surprised face—

4
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:19,260
I can't get over how cute you are.

5
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,670
on tiptoe, I tap the neon

6
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:24,340
and sparks of light jump up and dance.

7
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:27,330
today I feel extra playful

8
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:28,720
only with you, again and again.

9
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:31,270
when your gaze follows me

10
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:33,650
my heart goes "pop-pop" and leaps.

11
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:34,980
almost caught, almost gone

12
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:38,490
should I run away for a sec…?

13
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,150
(but you'll catch me in no time.)

14
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:43,560
when I hop along in front of you

15
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:45,950
you come closer smiling, don't you?

16
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:48,350
as I twirl through neon light

17
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:51,300
you reach out and call my name.

18
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,760
I'm only teasing a little

19
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:55,300
so why does my heart flutter this much.

20
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,790
every time I see you

21
00:00:56,790 --> 00:01:00,630
little hearts go "pop-pop," bursting out.

22
00:01:00,630 --> 00:01:02,740
close to your arms

23
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:05,130
when I catch your eye

24
00:01:05,130 --> 00:01:07,370
the moment you smile

25
00:01:07,370 --> 00:01:09,650
the world turns pink.

26
00:01:09,650 --> 00:01:12,050
behind loose strands of hair

27
00:01:12,050 --> 00:01:14,920
your fingertips almost brush mine…

28
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:16,860
that feeling makes

29
00:01:16,860 --> 00:01:20,960
my cheeks grow warm again.

30
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:24,440
it's okay to come a little closer.

31
00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:29,150
today I just feel like teasing.

32
00:01:29,150 --> 00:01:30,360
when you smile

33
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:32,110
I end up smiling too…

34
00:01:32,110 --> 00:01:33,920
(this isn't a secret, right?)

35
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:36,350
when I hop along in front of you

36
00:01:36,350 --> 00:01:38,770
you come closer smiling, don't you?

37
00:01:38,770 --> 00:01:41,170
as I twirl through neon light

38
00:01:41,170 --> 00:01:44,100
you reach out and call my name.

39
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:46,560
it was only a little tease

40
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:48,530
but when you hold me, I melt.

41
00:01:48,530 --> 00:01:50,960
every time you're near

42
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:53,730
my heart goes "pop-pop-pop" and dances.

43
00:02:03,070 --> 00:02:07,510
should I run away? no—catch me.

44
00:02:07,510 --> 00:02:09,970
just kidding… but I mean it.

45
00:02:09,970 --> 00:02:12,940
seeing your smiling face

46
00:02:12,940 --> 00:02:17,160
makes me want to act cute again.

47
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:19,560
when I run through the light

48
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:21,970
you hold me like you've been waiting for me.

49
00:02:21,970 --> 00:02:24,390
the two of us beneath tonight's neon—

50
00:02:24,390 --> 00:02:27,230
our little game, just for two.

51
00:02:27,230 --> 00:02:29,750
light footsteps, a fluttering heart

52
00:02:29,750 --> 00:02:31,730
I bounce up again when I see you.

53
00:02:31,730 --> 00:02:33,540
by your side again today

54
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:38,460
my heart goes "pop!" and bursts out.

